
Section
Tag="ENG"

[MapSettings]
LegendMap="10 March 2008, 3:20 AM|Poznan, Poland||A railroad depot in the middle of the night.|| 1 on 1 ESL verison || by descent & damian3k"
LegendMapInBrief="1. ALLEYS||2. CONTROL ROOMS||3. CAR PARK||4. TRAIN MAINTENANCE"
ExpliMapInBriefSpy="This railroad depot has recently been identified as a place from which a terrorist cell is hacking into an important communications node. You must stop this hacking operation and neutralize your opponent's power to do harm. Security has recently been strenghtened, so you must be doubly cautious."
ExpliMapInBriefSentry="Our customers use the depot as a remote site for hacking into a major node of communications. Its security may have been compromised by the recent arrest of one of our customers associates. Your mission is to prevent any potential intruders from damaging our customer's equipment. If the computer attaché cases were to be compromised, ARGUS PMC would lose a customer. As for you, you'd lose your job."
ModesStrings=((ExplicationModeSpy§(6553)="Reach the 2 mission objectives to put a stop to the network hacking.",ExplicationModeSentry§(6550)="Protect the objectives and neutralize the intruders.",ExpliModeInBriefSpy§(6554)="Your insertion point will be the ALLEYS adjoining the depot. The guards can't access the alleys, but their projectiles can. From the alleys, infiltrate the administrative premises. They include the CONTROL ROOMS and a CAR PARK. To reach the TRAIN MAINTENANCE ZONE, where the consoles are located, you must either hack into a terminal in one of the two control rooms, or use explosives in the parking lot. Deactivate one of the three terminals or take hdd in the TRAIN MAINTENANCE ZONE.",LegendModeInBriefSpy§(6555)="The spies must accomplish a certain number of mission objectives. The latter can be of three kinds. The mercenaries must prevent them, or eliminate the spies.",ExpliModeInBriefSentry§(6551)="The intruders will infiltrate by the adjacent ALLEYS. For reasons of discretion, you cannot patrol there, but there's nothing to stop you from keeping them in your sights. Our customer's 3 attaché cases are located in the TRAIN MAINTENANCE ZONE. None of them must be deactivated. Prevent the intruders from accessing this zone: they will doubtlessly try to hack into the terminal in the CONTROL ROOMS or use explosives in the CAR PARK.",LegendModeInBriefSentry§(6552)="The spies must accomplish a certain number of mission objectives. The latter can be of three kinds. The mercenaries must prevent them, or eliminate the spies."),(ExplicationModeSpy§(6553)="Eliminate all of the members of the ARGUS PMC who are present.",ExplicationModeSentry§(6550)="Eliminate all the intruders seeking to infiltrate the zone you defend.",ExpliModeInBriefSpy§(6554)="Your insertion point will be the ALLEYS adjoining the depot. The guards can't access the alleys, but their projectiles can. From the alleys, infiltrate the administrative premises. They include the CONTROL ROOMS and a CAR PARK. To reach the train maintenance zone, you must either hack into a terminal in one of the two control rooms, or use explosives in the parking lot.",LegendModeInBriefSpy§(6555)="The spies, like the mercenaries, must eliminate the opposing team entirely.",ExpliModeInBriefSentry§(6551)="The intruders will infiltrate by the adjacent ALLEYS. For reasons of discretion, you cannot patrol there, but there's nothing to stop you from keeping them in your sights. Prevent the intruders from accessing the TRAIN MAINTENANCE ZONE: they will doubtless try to hack into the terminal in the CONTROL ROOMS or use explosives in the CAR PARK.",LegendModeInBriefSentry§(6552)="The spies, like the mercenaries, must eliminate the opposing team entirely."),(ExplicationModeSpy§(6553)="Find and keep the data disks.",ExplicationModeSentry§(6550)="Prevent the intruders from seizing the data disks.",ExpliModeInBriefSpy§(6554)="Your insertion point will be the ALLEYS adjoining the depot. The guards can't access the alleys, but their projectiles can. ",LegendModeInBriefSpy§(6555)="The spies must go through the level and get their hands on a certain number of disks. The mercenaries must prevent them, or eliminate the spies.",ExpliModeInBriefSentry§(6551)="The intruders will infiltrate by the adjacent ALLEYS. For reasons of discretion, you cannot patrol there, but there's nothing to stop you from keeping them in your sights. ",LegendModeInBriefSentry§(6552)="The spies must go through the level and get their hands on a certain number of disks. The mercenaries must prevent them, or eliminate the spies."))
